{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09568","headline":"初过陇山途中呈宇文判官 · 岑参","name":"初过陇山途中呈宇文判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一驿过一驿，驿骑如星流。\n平明发咸阳，暮及陇山头。\n陇水不可听，呜咽令人愁。\n沙尘扑马汗，雾露凝貂裘。\n西来谁家子，自道新封侯。\n前月发安西，路上无停留。\n都护犹未到，来时在西州。\n十日过沙碛，终朝风不休。\n马走碎石中，四蹄皆血流。\n万里奉王事，一身无所求。\n也知塞垣苦，岂爲妻子谋。\n山口月欲出，先照关城楼。\n谿流与松风，静夜相飕飀。\n别家赖归梦，山塞多离忧。\n与子且携手，不愁前路修。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}